[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pulls/49","id":4815703175,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUvwaHc8AAAABHwnMhw","html_url":"https://github.com/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pull/49","diff_url":"https://github.com/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pull/49.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pull/49.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/issues/49","number":49,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(tui): keep the chat tail anchored when the thinking block is focused","user":{"login":"DannyBaanks","id":297375186,"node_id":"U_kgDOEbmV0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297375186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks","html_url":"https://github.com/DannyBaanks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- While the model is thinking, clicking/focusing the expanded reasoning block used `Widget.focus()`'s default `scroll_visible=True`. That centred the tall block and **released the `ChatArea` tail anchor**, so the viewport jumped up and never scrolled back — the model's answer appeared off-screen (la ventana \"se va arriba\" y no se ve la respuesta).\n- Fix: route the box/click focus paths through `focus(scroll_visible=False)` and re-arm the chat tail in `ThoughtBlock._watch_collapsed` after a toggle.\n- Adds a deterministic regression test that **fails without the fix** (chat jumps 90→53 and drops the tail) and passes with it.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `test_focused_box_expansion.py::test_clicking_expanded_thinking_keeps_chat_at_tail` — passes with fix, fails on `main`\n- [x] `test_focused_box_expansion.py`, `test_model_reasoning_ui.py`, `test_chat_sequence.py`, `test_integrated_layout.py` — 18 passed\n- [x] Full suite running in CI/local (isolated change to focus paths)\n\nConfirmed root cause by instrumenting `Widget.release_anchor` in Textual 8.2.8 and reproducing the tail release via the real click handler.","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:14:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T01:14:21Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3691e1a16f7dd042b837b843f37f70dbb6c0f8f1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pulls/49/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pulls/49/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/issues/49/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DannyBaanks/ISyCode/statuses/c9bb088533694959dc2d5924612fc4a217c610bd","head":{"label":"DannyBaanks:fix/thinking-tail-anchor","ref":"fix/thinking-tail-anchor","sha":"c9bb088533694959dc2d5924612fc4a217c610bd","user":{"login":"DannyBaanks","id":297375186,"node_id":"U_kgDOEbmV0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297375186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks","html_url":"https://github.com/DannyBaanks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyBaanks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https